00:22:01.500 --> 00:22:04.423
I happened to be living in.

00:22:09.410 --> 00:22:13.743
I forget the name of the
church but it's very known.

00:22:15.920 --> 00:22:20.257
It was off of Vernon
and Broadway somewhere.

00:22:26.320 --> 00:22:28.487
I only stayed three days
before I came out here.

00:22:28.487 --> 00:22:30.397
And didn't know my way around (chuckling).

00:22:34.240 --> 00:22:35.790
Quickly got it up here, though.

00:22:42.710 --> 00:22:44.600
I wouldn't change that.

00:22:44.600 --> 00:22:47.860
I wouldn't change my
steps that have made me

00:22:47.860 --> 00:22:52.053
what I am or made my mind conscious.

00:22:59.320 --> 00:23:03.090
Made my mind conscious to such poison

00:23:05.370 --> 00:23:06.823
that lurks in any avenue.

00:23:10.000 --> 00:23:12.863
Whether it's drugs or people,

00:23:16.450 --> 00:23:18.950
we're all poisonous in some type of way.

00:23:18.950 --> 00:23:21.200
All things are poisonous
in some type of way.

00:23:24.310 --> 00:23:25.643
It's just how you view it.

00:23:27.300 --> 00:23:32.300
How you analyze it, decipher
it, code it, whatever.

00:23:45.905 --> 00:23:48.950
You just have to be the one

00:23:48.950 --> 00:23:52.813
to know how you want to live.

00:24:08.393 --> 00:24:11.643
All you can do is do right by yourself.

00:24:13.640 --> 00:24:16.060
Don't worry about other's thoughts.

00:24:16.060 --> 00:24:19.623
Don't worry about other's
images, they're varying.

00:24:21.150 --> 00:24:23.800
How they're getting by or
how they get their success.

00:24:25.940 --> 00:24:27.940
It's up to you to make your own success.

00:24:34.170 --> 00:24:35.590
Not the success in the stage

00:24:35.590 --> 00:24:39.173
that I see I've stagnated myself in.

00:24:42.750 --> 00:24:44.393
Yeah, it's a small success.

00:24:45.483 --> 00:24:48.033
A lot of people would say,
no, the hell that isn't.

00:24:50.970 --> 00:24:53.750
But it's a small success
to me because I realize

00:24:58.397 --> 00:25:02.347
that it took me a lot to
get through to this point.

00:25:05.547 --> 00:25:06.547
That I know.

00:25:09.207 --> 00:25:10.040
I know.

00:25:13.330 --> 00:25:14.373
They can never know.

00:25:17.510 --> 00:25:19.160
You really wouldn't want to know.

00:25:36.413 --> 00:25:38.496
I always give the advice,

00:25:40.310 --> 00:25:45.310
hold your head, smile
through your tears (crying).

00:25:50.340 --> 00:25:52.303
Through your tears, always smile.

00:25:53.920 --> 00:25:55.143
I do my best.

00:25:59.380 --> 00:26:01.940
'Cause it's what helps
me aid through the day

00:26:01.940 --> 00:26:04.313
even when I don't want
to go through the day.

00:26:15.671 --> 00:26:17.670
I don't like drama.

00:26:17.670 --> 00:26:22.413
So I stay afloat.

00:26:31.240 --> 00:26:36.003
Life only causes you all
that you can give it.

